 d/261/width/500/height/499/29248_America250-bloomington.rev.1765915309.pn
 g 1x" data-origin="responsive"/><img width="500" height="499" alt="" data
 -alt="" data-decoration="true" src="https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/
 261/width/500/height/499/29248_America250-bloomington.rev.1765915309.png"
  data-max-w="729" data-max-h="727" loading="lazy" data-optimized="true"/>
 </picture></span></p>
