SUMMARY:Unprinting 3D Prints
DESCRIPTION:Techniques include layering\, curing\, and wet sanding. Primi
 ng will be covered with an outdoor demonstration\, if weather permits. Pr
 int settings are touched on early to emphasize reducing labor. Bring a 3D
  print or use a demonstration model provided.  Target Audience: Beginner+
  3D printer users  Learning Outcomes:  Optimizing print settings for post
 -production  Finishing techniques  Safety considerations
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Techniques include layering\, curing\, 
 and wet sanding. Priming will be covered with an outdoor demonstration\, 
 if weather permits. Print settings are touched on early to emphasize redu
 cing labor. Bring a 3D print or use a demonstration model provided.</p><p
 >  Target Audience: Beginner+ 3D printer users</p><p>  Learning Outcomes:
 <br />  Optimizing print settings for post-production<br />  Finishing te
 chniques<br />  Safety considerations</p>
